        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Management will make every reasonable effort to properly assign part time employees but where a disagreement arises over such assignment, two (2) weeks shall be permitted after written notice for investigation and the Company will not be liable for any differences in payment until that period has passed.",
